# Station 4's plate. A real area light: "# tyra-glow-light" is what says it
# lights the room, and under global illumination the bake traces its actual
# geometry - so the post in front of it throws a soft-edged shadow and the
# alcove walls pick up its colour by bounce, not by a falloff formula.
newmtl gi-lava
# tyra-brightness 1
Kd 1.0000 0.4200 0.0600
# tyra-glow 1 1 0.42 0.06 0.25
# tyra-glow-light 14 2.1
Ke 1.2500 0.6700 0.3100
